===============================================================================
DATASET LICENSE & ATTRIBUTION NOTICE
===============================================================================

Dataset Path: dataset/dataset_fine_tuning.csv

The dataset located in `dataset/dataset_fine_tuning.csv` is a subset 
derived from the News Commentary parallel corpus, annotated for the presence 
of phrasal verbs. 

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LICENSING
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

According to the official specifications provided at:
http://data.statmt.org/news-commentary/README

